// Makes combo box number rbi_k showing the text rbs_t with the choices of its command, in place of the one that was there, and puts it where its control stands in the open tab of the ribbon rib; for a command with no control in the tab it is made and left unplaced, and rbd_cx says so with -1.
ribbon_combo_make(Ribbon rib, int ribbon_combo_make_number, string ribbon_combo_make_text) {
